@baseUrl = http://localhost:5201
@apiKey = prueba-tecnica-api-key-123

# Los ids de ejemplo (1) asumen una base recién creada. Ajustarlos si ya hay datos.

### ---------- Públicos (sin API Key) ----------

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Documento OpenAPI
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Sin API Key -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### ---------- Users ----------

### Crear usuario (body del enunciado) -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan",
  "email": "juan@test.com"
}

### Crear usuario con password (opcional, se guarda hasheado) -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana",
  "email": "ana@test.com",
  "password": "secreta123"
}

### Crear usuario inválido -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "no-es-un-email"
}

### Email duplicado (no distingue mayúsculas) -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Otro Juan",
  "email": "JUAN@test.com"
}

### Listar usuarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

### Listar usuarios activos
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?isActive=true
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

### Listar usuarios inactivos
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?isActive=false
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

### Obtener usuario por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

### Obtener usuario inexistente -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/999
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

### Modificar usuario (name, email, isActive son obligatorios)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/1
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan Pérez",
  "email": "juan@test.com",
  "isActive": false
}

### Modificar usuario con el email de otro -> 409
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/1
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan",
  "email": "ana@test.com",
  "isActive": true
}

### ---------- Addresses ----------

### Crear dirección para un usuario -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/1/addresses
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "street": "Calle Falsa 123",
  "city": "Asunción",
  "country": "Paraguay",
  "zipCode": "9999"
}

### Crear dirección para usuario inexistente -> 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/999/addresses
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "street": "Calle Falsa 123",
  "city": "Asunción",
  "country": "Paraguay"
}

### Listar direcciones de un usuario
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1/addresses
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

### Obtener dirección por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/addresses/1
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

### Modificar dirección
PUT {{baseUrl}}/addresses/1
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "street": "Av. Mariscal López 456",
  "city": "Asunción",
  "country": "Paraguay",
  "zipCode": "1209"
}

### Eliminar dirección -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/addresses/1
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

### ---------- Currencies ----------

### Listar monedas (incluye las semilla: PYG, USD, EUR, BRL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/currencies
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

### Obtener moneda por código
GET {{baseUrl}}/currencies/usd
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

### Crear moneda (el código se guarda en mayúsculas) -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/currencies
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "ars",
  "name": "Peso argentino",
  "rateToBase": 7.5
}

### Crear moneda duplicada -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/currencies
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "USD",
  "name": "Dólar",
  "rateToBase": 7300
}

### Convertir 100 USD a PYG -> 730000
POST {{baseUrl}}/currency/convert
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromCurrencyCode": "USD",
  "toCurrencyCode": "PYG",
  "amount": 100
}

### Convertir 100 EUR a BRL
POST {{baseUrl}}/currency/convert
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromCurrencyCode": "EUR",
  "toCurrencyCode": "BRL",
  "amount": 100
}

### Convertir con moneda inexistente -> 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/currency/convert
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromCurrencyCode": "XXX",
  "toCurrencyCode": "PYG",
  "amount": 100
}

### ---------- Limpieza ----------

### Eliminar usuario (borra sus direcciones en cascada) -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/1
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
